### Unit Tests
- Test JSON Schema validation with valid/invalid records
- Test deterministic ID generation
- Test BigQuery row formatting

### Integration Tests
- Test end-to-end flow with sample files
- Test quarantine bucket movement
- Test Pub/Sub notification publishing

### Manual Tests
- Upload valid JSON file → verify BigQuery insertion
- Upload invalid JSON file → verify quarantine movement
- Upload mixed file → verify partial processing

